| `ratio`         | Single-speed reduction, machine to differential (Nissan)                         | --  |   8.193 |
| `P_aux`         | Power drawn by the 12 V network (assumed)                         | W  |   300.0 |
| `SoC0`         | Battery state of charge at t = 0 (assumed)                         | --  |   0.9 |

